# QA Learning Journal

## About This Repository

This repository documents my learning journey in Quality Assurance (QA) and software testing. It contains practice activities, requirement reviews, risk analysis, test conditions, and testing-related learning records.

## Learning Goals

- Understand software testing fundamentals.
- Review requirements and identify risks.
- Write clear and useful test conditions.
- Practice functional, negative, and boundary testing.
- Learn to evaluate test coverage.
- Develop practical QA skills through structured exercises.

